Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
From the sacling of all the data: \[Epsilon]/\[CapitalDelta] ~ Exp[-const ] \
but there still is an L dependence 
(very likely a Log correction): Log[Cos[x]^2] ~ Log[(1 - (x)^2/2)^2]\
\>", "Section",
